    <briefdescription>
<para>A struct to densely store the state of an instruction after unrolling at each iteration. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This is designed to work like a tuple of &lt;<ref refid="classllvm_1_1_instruction" kindref="compound">Instruction</ref> *, int&gt; for the purposes of hashing and lookup, but to be able to associate two boolean states with each key. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
